From: mpv-ht <build@mpv-ht.invalid>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 14:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] win32: reuse the primary player before scripts and display setup

Read the persistent single-instance preference, serialize startup, and forward
files with acknowledged IPC commands. Keep independent diagnostic launches.

---
